  "dataSourceInstructions": "This datasource is a lakehouse (SQL).  It holds **static /\nsnapshot** rows for entities -- ids, dimension attributes, and the\nforeign keys needed to join across entities.\n\nThe block below is the slice of the ontology bound to this\nlakehouse: entity -> physical table mapping, non-obvious column\naliases, identifier / display-name designations, and relationships\nrendered as ``<table>.<fk_col> = <other_table>.<pk_col>`` join\nexpressions that drop straight into a SQL ``JOIN ... ON`` clause.\nProperties listed bare (no ``= phys_col``) use a column whose name\nis the snake_case form of the property name.  Lines tagged\n``eventhouse-only TS (<table>): ...`` name metric columns that live\nin an eventhouse, not here -- do not SELECT or invent them.\n\n--- BEGIN LAKEHOUSE ONTOLOGY SLICE ---\nOntology: ONT_Wildfire_Impact\n\n== ENTITIES ==\n\nAircraft  (table=node_aircraft, id=Id, disp=Name)\n  props: Id, Name, Latitude, Longitude, SnapshotTime=SnapshotTime, Mode, ObservedAt=ObservedAt, Role, InferredFirefighting=InferredFirefighting, HeadingDeg=HeadingDeg, AltitudeM=AltitudeM, Interpretation\n\nCommune  (table=node_commune, id=Id, disp=Name)\n  props: Id, Name, Latitude, Longitude, SnapshotTime=SnapshotTime, Mode, Population, Department, Interpretation\n\nCriticalInfrastructure  (table=node_criticalinfrastructure, id=Id, disp=Name)\n  props: Id, Name, Latitude, Longitude, SnapshotTime=SnapshotTime, Mode, Category, Interpretation\n\nDetection  (table=node_detection, id=Id, disp=Name)\n  props: Id, Name, Latitude, Longitude, SnapshotTime=SnapshotTime, Mode, ObservedAt=ObservedAt, Satellite, SensorTier=SensorTier, FrpMW=FrpMW\n\nFireStation  (table=node_firestation, id=Id, disp=Name)\n  props: Id, Name, Latitude, Longitude, SnapshotTime=SnapshotTime, Mode, Category, Interpretation\n\nFireZone  (table=node_firezone, id=Id, disp=Name)\n  props: Id, Name, Latitude, Longitude, SnapshotTime=SnapshotTime, Mode, LastSeen=LastSeen, PeakDetectionMW=PeakDetectionMW, LatestFrameMW=LatestFrameMW, DetectionCount=DetectionCount, ObservationStatus=ObservationStatus, GrowthPct=GrowthPct, Interpretation\n\nWaterBody  (table=node_waterbody, id=Id, disp=Name)\n  props: Id, Name, Latitude, Longitude, SnapshotTime=SnapshotTime, Mode, Category, Interpretation\n\nWeather  (table=node_weather, id=Id, disp=Name)\n  props: Id, Name, Latitude, Longitude, SnapshotTime=SnapshotTime, Mode, ObservedAt=ObservedAt, WindFromDeg=WindFromDeg, WindToDeg=WindToDeg, WindKmh=WindKmh, HumidityPct=HumidityPct\n\n== RELATIONSHIPS ==\n(format: RelName: fk_table.fk_col = pk_table.pk_col)\ndownwindScreen: edge_downwindscreen.SourceId = node_firezone.Id AND edge_downwindscreen.TargetId = node_commune.Id\nnearCommune: edge_nearcommune.SourceId = node_firezone.Id AND edge_nearcommune.TargetId = node_commune.Id\nnearInfrastructure: edge_nearinfrastructure.SourceId = node_firezone.Id AND edge_nearinfrastructure.TargetId = node_criticalinfrastructure.Id\nnearbyAircraft: edge_nearbyaircraft.SourceId = node_aircraft.Id AND edge_nearbyaircraft.TargetId = node_firezone.Id\nobservedIn: edge_observedin.SourceId = node_detection.Id AND edge_observedin.TargetId = node_firezone.Id\nscoopOption: edge_scoopoption.SourceId = node_firezone.Id AND edge_scoopoption.TargetId = node_waterbody.Id\nstationOption: edge_stationoption.SourceId = node_firezone.Id AND edge_stationoption.TargetId = node_firestation.Id\nweatherContext: edge_weathercontext.SourceId = node_firezone.Id AND edge_weathercontext.TargetId = node_weather.Id\n--- END LAKEHOUSE ONTOLOGY SLICE ---\n",
  "displayName": "LH_WildFires",
